{{also|schrift}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|schrift|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|scrift|lang=goh}}. Abstractum of {{term|schreiben||to [[write]]|lang=de}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ʃʁɪft]|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|ɪft|lang=de}}

===Noun===
